## Installation

Install ast-grep globally:

```bash
# Using cargo (recommended)
cargo install ast-grep

# Using npm
npm install -g @ast-grep/cli

# Using brew (macOS)
brew install ast-grep
```

Verify installation:

```bash
sg --version
```

